Value Required LOCAL_INTERFACE (\S+)
Value PARENT_INTERFACE (\S+)
Value Required CHASSIS_ID (\S+)
Value Required NEIGHBOR_INTERFACE (\S+)
Value Required NEIGHBOR_NAME (\S+)
Value REMOTE_IP (\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+)
Value NEIGHBOR_DESCRIPTION (.+?)

Start
  ^LLDP Neighbor Information: -> Continue.Record
  ^Local Interface\s+:\s+${LOCAL_INTERFACE}
  ^Parent Interface\s+:\s+${PARENT_INTERFACE}
  ^Chassis ID\s+:\s+${CHASSIS_ID}
  ^Port ID\s+:\s+${NEIGHBOR_INTERFACE}
  ^System name\s+:\s+${NEIGHBOR_NAME}
  ^System Description\s*:\s+${NEIGHBOR_DESCRIPTION}\s*$$
  ^\s+Address Type\s+:\s+IPv4 -> GetIP

GetIP
  ^\s+Address\s+:\s+${REMOTE_IP} -> Start